{
  "id": 475818305,
  "iid": 24498,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "RTPS: Add DDSServiceRequest topic info for Service Request channel",
  "description": "Register a static type_mapping for ENTITYID_RTI_BUILTIN_SERVICE_REQUEST\nso that DATA, HEARTBEAT, ACKNACK, and other submessages on the Service\nRequest builtin endpoint display \"[Topic Information (BuiltIn type)]\"\nwith topic name DDSServiceRequest and type name DDS_ServiceRequest.\n\nPreviously these frames showed no topic annotation because the Service\nRequest endpoint does not go through SEDP discovery and was not in the\ntopic registry.\n\nAlso extract an RTPS_IS_BUILTIN_TYPE_MAPPING macro to replace the\nduplicated is_builtin_type check, so adding future builtin type\nmappings only requires updating one location.\n\nAI-Assisted: yes (Copilot)",
  "state": "merged",
  "created_at": "2026-04-20T20:09:47.896Z",
  "updated_at": "2026-04-22T07:12:16.249Z",
